Weather content is supplied by Open-Meteo, https://open-meteo.com/,
under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0. Forecast presentation converts units,
selects the requested day range, and omits unavailable fields. The free API
endpoint is restricted to noncommercial use under its service terms.
https://open-meteo.com/en/terms
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

City search uses Open-Meteo's geocoding API, with location data based on
GeoNames, https://www.geonames.org/. Provider attribution and current terms:
https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/geocoding-api

